    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition/modim" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n310.jpg">
        <tei:p><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/hodaah/modim">We thank Thee for Thou art the Lord our God and the God of our fathers for ever and ever. The Rock of our life, the Shield of our salvation art Thou from generation to generation. We thank Thee and tell of Thy fame for our life that is delivered in Thy hand for our souls that are entrusted to Thee and for Thy miracles that are daily with us and for Thy wonders and benefits at all times, evening, morning and noon. O Thou who art good for Thy mercies never end, O Thou who showest mercy for Thy <tei:choice><tei:sic>sindnesses</tei:sic><tei:corr>kindnesses</tei:corr></tei:choice> never cease, ever have we trusted in Thee.</tei:seg> </tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
